# Tauri build output
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
# Cargo.lock is *not* ignored — the desktop crate is an application, not a
# library, and CI needs exact dep versions to reproduce the local build.
# Without it, `cargo update` resolves fresh deps on every CI run and trait
# coherence conflicts (notably `time 0.3.48` vs `tauri-utils 2.9.2`) can
# silently break the build. Committing the lock pins all transitive deps.

# Bundled assets cache
.tauri/

# Staged runtime — downloaded llama-server, built PyApp launcher, staged
# Phoenix release. All reproducible via `make ai-worker-launcher`,
# `make desktop-stage-llama`, and `make desktop-stage-phoenix`.
runtime/

